{"n": 1272, "src": "Keby si kúpil vlastnú powerbanku, nepotreboval by jej pomoc na každom výlete.", "en": "If he bought his own power bank, he wouldn't need her help on every trip.", "lk_supplied": "bought", "topic": "2. Conditional", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1273, "src": "Kým odídu z parku, powerbanka nabije jeho telefón na sto percent.", "en": "By the time they leave the park, the power bank will have charged his phone to a hundred per cent.", "lk_supplied": "will have charged", "topic": "Future Perfect Simple", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": true}
{"n": 1274, "src": "Čierna mačka sa nehýbe a biela tiež nie — úplné sochy.", "en": "The black cat isn't moving, and neither is the white one — total statues.", "lk_supplied": "neither", "topic": "So, Neither, Nor", "level": "B1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1275, "src": "O tých dvoch mačkách sa hovorí, že sú najfotografovanejšia dvojica na pobreží.", "en": "The two cats are said to be the most photographed pair on this whole shore.", "lk_supplied": "are said", "topic": "Advanced Passive Voice", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1276, "src": "Keby stopy boli staršie, teraz by to vzdali.", "en": "If the tracks were older, they would give up now.", "lk_supplied": "were", "topic": "2. Conditional", "level": "B1", "person": "3pl", "number": "pl", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1277, "src": "Blato bolo hlboké; napriek tomu, držali sa stopy.", "en": "The mud was deep; nevertheless, they kept on the trail.", "lk_supplied": "nevertheless", "topic": "Advanced linkers", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1278, "src": "Stará kanvica stojí na modrom plameni.", "en": "The old kettle stands on the blue flame.", "lk_supplied": "on", "topic": "Prepositions of place/time", "level": "A1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1279, "src": "Pozri! Plyn práve horí modrým plameňom.", "en": "Look! The gas is burning with a blue flame.", "lk_supplied": "is burning", "topic": "Present Continuous", "level": "A2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1280, "src": "Tento krokodíl vylieza z vody.", "en": "This crocodile is coming out of the water.", "lk_supplied": "This", "topic": "This, That, These...", "level": "A1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 1281, "src": "Dnes pláva a včera tu plával tiež.", "en": "It swims today, and it swam here yesterday too.", "lk_supplied": "swam", "topic": "Present or Past Simple", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1282, "src": "Zo všetkých súčiastok v stroji ozubené koleso, ktoré namontoval ako posledné, bolo najväčšie.", "en": "Of all the parts in the machine, the gear he fitted last was the biggest.", "lk_supplied": "the gear", "topic": "Articles advanced", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1283, "src": "To more má vysoké vlny a biele skaly.", "en": "The sea has got high waves and white rocks.", "lk_supplied": "has got", "topic": "HAVE GOT", "level": "A1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1284, "src": "More je slané, ale plávajú v ňom celý deň.", "en": "The sea is salty, but they swim in it all day.", "lk_supplied": "but", "topic": "Basic conjunctions", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1285, "src": "Ak bude pršať silnejšie, Tom si natiahne kapucňu a pobeží ďalej.", "en": "If it rains harder, Tom will pull his hood up and keep going anyway.", "lk_supplied": "will pull", "topic": "1. Conditional", "level": "B1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": true}
{"n": 1286, "src": "Tom netušil, že sa jeho ľahký ranný beh zmení na každodenný zvyk.", "en": "Tom had no idea that his easy morning jog would turn into a daily habit.", "lk_supplied": "would turn", "topic": "Future in past", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 1287, "src": "Čašník je oblečený vo formálnej uniforme s čiernym motýlikom.", "en": "The waiter is dressed in a formal uniform with a black bow tie.", "lk_supplied": "is dressed", "topic": "Passive or Active", "level": "B1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1288, "src": "Čo má ona najprv na sebe? Džínsovú bundu.", "en": "What does she wear first? A denim jacket.", "lk_supplied": "What", "topic": "Wh- questions", "level": "A1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1289, "src": "Skvelá voľba, samozrejme. Nabudúce ona si vezme ten klobúk s perím do práce.", "en": "Great choice, obviously. Next time she will wear the feathered hat to work.", "lk_supplied": "will wear", "topic": "Future with WILL", "level": "A2", "person": "1pl", "number": "pl", "perfective_present": true}
{"n": 1290, "src": "Baby, povedal mi, že kým dorazili na vrchol, pot mu už stiekol do očí.", "en": "Girl, he told me the sweat had run into his eyes by the time they reached the top.", "lk_supplied": "had run", "topic": "Past Perfect Simple", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1291, "src": "Bielizeň, žehliaca doska, žehlička: pre tú ženu je to nabitý deň.", "en": "Laundry, ironing board, iron: it is a busy day for the woman.", "lk_supplied": "a", "topic": "A, AN, THE", "level": "A1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1292, "src": "Počuj, povedala mi, že zaneprázdnená žena by mala si dať pauzu.", "en": "Listen, she told me a busy woman should take a break.", "lk_supplied": "should", "topic": "Modal verb SHOULD", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1293, "src": "Teraz má slobodu, tak si myslím, že on bude slobodný.", "en": "He has freedom now, so I think he will be free.", "lk_supplied": "will be", "topic": "Going to or Will", "level": "A2", "person": "1sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 1294, "src": "Kedy kráča pomalá korytnačka? Vo dne v noci.", "en": "When does the slow tortoise walk? Day and night.", "lk_supplied": "When", "topic": "Wh- questions", "level": "A1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": true}
